<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -State Street Boston raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -State Street Boston raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its rating on State Street Boston Corp to long-term buy from accumulate while keeping its rating at near-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 55-3/4.</p>
</text>
